      RowBox[{"\"\<nu spec at \>\"", "<>", 
       RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"snapTimes", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "5", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
       "<>", "\"\< seconds post-bounce\>\""}]}], ",", 
